@page "/error-boundary"

<PageTitle>Part14 · ErrorBoundary</PageTitle>
<h1>ErrorBoundary</h1>

<p>未捕获异常会被 <code>&lt;ErrorBoundary&gt;</code> 接住，显示回退内容而非崩溃整个 circuit。</p>

<ErrorBoundary>
    <ChildContent>
        @if (_throw)
        {
            <Throwing />
        }
        else
        {
            <p>No error. 点下方按钮触发异常。</p>
        }
    </ChildContent>
    <ErrorContent>
        <p role="alert" style="color:red">已捕获异常：ErrorBoundary 兜底。</p>
    </ErrorContent>
</ErrorBoundary>

<button class="icon-btn" style="background:var(--color-surface-container)" @onclick="() => _throw = true">Throw</button>

@code {
    private bool _throw;
}
